  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - models aligned with the live API. Breaking: date and time fields are now settable\nDateTime?/TimeOnly? properties (blank, \"NA\" and \"0000-00-00\" read as null), and several mistyped or\nmisnamed members were corrected. Fixed: fundamentals failed for every ETF and live quotes for\ndelisted symbols; GetFundamentalsDataAsync section filters now work; string fields accept bare\nnumbers; dropped fields now bind. Added: mutual-fund data, crypto Tech/Resources, exchange\nearly-close days, and other fields the API sends.\n\nFull history: https://github.com/mrut2pac/EODHD.CSharpApiClient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
